      "summary": "Evidence summary: 4 validated structured observations; consult observations and conflicts for supported findings.",
      "observations": [
        {
          "category": "mechanics",
          "statement": "Geo-Mod destruction is the defining mechanic: explosives can open alternate routes, bypass doors and create shortcuts, although players also note that the campaign uses this freedom less often than the technology suggests.",
