          ]
        },
        {
          "category": "structure",
          "statement": "The single-player campaign is an old-school Mars-set first-person shooter with a story-driven continuous level flow, varied weapons and occasional vehicles; players still value the premise and variety but describe some later stretches as more linear than the opening suggests.",
