      "observations": [
        {
          "category": "mechanics",
          "statement": "The core loop combines brick-breaking trajectories with survivor-style enemy waves and roguelite upgrades; players repeatedly praise the tactile ricochets and the way ball fusions can produce highly destructive build combinations.",
