          ]
        },
        {
          "category": "repetition",
          "statement": "The main recurring trade-off is long-term repetition: after the early discovery phase, some players find later runs, ascension-style scaling and stat-focused meta upgrades less varied than the large initial pool of balls and characters suggests.",
          "sentiment": "negative",
          "recurrence": "moderate",
